# =============================================================================
# Dovahkiin project - repository root
# =============================================================================
# This repo is rooted at RimWorldFolder because the project lives in TWO sibling
# folders that a repo inside either one could not reach:
#
#   DovahkiinClaudePluged\   the design documents (SPEC, ROADMAP, COMPAT, ...)
#   Mods\Dovahkiin\          the mod itself
#
# Everything else under this root is the RimWorld installation and 40 other
# mods, none of which belongs in version control.
#
# The pattern below is deny-by-default. Order matters, and git will not let you
# re-include a file whose PARENT DIRECTORY is excluded - which is why Mods\ is
# re-included first and only then narrowed to Mods\Dovahkiin\.
# =============================================================================

# 1. Ignore everything at the root.
/*

# 2. Allow this file back.
!/.gitignore

# 3. Allow the design documents.
!/DovahkiinClaudePluged/

# 4. Allow Mods\ as a directory, but nothing inside it...
!/Mods/
/Mods/*

# 5. ...except our own mod.
!/Mods/Dovahkiin/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mods\Dovahkiin\.gitignore adds the mod-specific rules on top of this:
# build intermediates, the machine-specific RimWorldPath.props, and game DLLs.
# Our own Assemblies\Dovahkiin.dll IS committed deliberately - it is what makes
# the repo directly usable as a mod without a build step.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Claude Code's per-machine settings. ".local" files are machine-specific by convention -
# this one holds an allowlist full of absolute paths from one PC and would only ever cause
# noise or conflicts on another. The shared CLAUDE.md IS committed; this is not.
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# OS noise, anywhere.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
